  "releaseNotes": "- [Sg] Heap: `HeapRenderObject.IsPickable` is per-bucket, known by construction (the bucket's ROs carry HeapNode's `HeapPickId` marker) instead of the whole heap. A non-pick bucket (e.g. a `Sg.NoEvents` sub-scene) no longer advertises pickability, so the dom stops routing it into the `PickId` pass where the backend forced a phantom `PickId` vertex input → `could not get attribute 'PickId'`. Fixes mixed pickable/non-pickable heaps.",
